rskrb5

This project is intended as a Rust compatibility port of gokrb5 v8.
gokrb5 is Copyright (c) its contributors and is licensed under Apache-2.0.

This repository currently contains only compatibility-spike code and does not
include copied gokrb5 implementation source.

rskrb5-ng modifies rskrb5: its changes are the commits after 6f4abc9 in https://github.com/andrico21/rskrb5-ng, described in PROVENANCE.md.
